    → And Jehovah showed the kindness of His people to the Egyptians. He saved them from their enemies.
    Exodus 12:37
      וַיִּסְעוּ בְנֵֽי־יִשְׂרָאֵל מֵרַעְמְסֵס סֻכֹּתָה כְּשֵׁשׁ־מֵאוֹת אֶלֶף רַגְלִי הַגְּבָרִים לְבַד מִטָּֽף׃
    → And the sons of Israel traveled from Reamsess Sukhotah, about six miles away from the giants alone.
