    → May the LORD bless me, who even at night still protects me from all harm.
    Psalms 16:8
      שִׁוִּיתִי יְהוָה לְנֶגְדִּי תָמִיד כִּי מִֽימִינִי בַּל־אֶמּֽוֹט׃
    → I have always opposed Jehovah, because from my right side comes nothing but harm.
    Psalms 16:9
