    → For I will not let my soul go to Sheol. Do not allow your faithful one to see the darkness.
    Psalms 16:11
      תּֽוֹדִיעֵנִי אֹרַח חַיִּים שֹׂבַע שְׂמָחוֹת אֶת־פָּנֶיךָ נְעִמוֹת בִּימִינְךָ נֶֽצַח׃
    → Please tell me about those living beings who are full of joy. Their faces are filled with happiness. They stand on your right side forever.
  Psalms 16 [en]: 11 vv, 1s
    Psalms 17:1
