    → Prayer for David: May Jehovah hear me, O righteous one. I will listen carefully to your prayers. My prayer is sincere, without any deceitful words.
    Psalms 17:2
      מִלְּפָנֶיךָ מִשְׁפָּטִי יֵצֵא עֵינֶיךָ תֶּחֱזֶינָה מֵישָׁרִֽים׃
    → From before you, my judgment has been revealed; your eyes shall see what is right.
    Psalms 17:3
      בָּחַנְתָּ לִבִּי ׀ פָּקַדְתָּ לַּיְלָה צְרַפְתַּנִי בַל־תִּמְצָא זַמֹּתִי בַּל־יַעֲבָר־פִּֽי׃
    → You have filled my heart with sorrow. You have troubled me all night, making it impossible for me to find any time to rest.
    Psalms 17:4
