    → And you, holy one, sit upon the throne of Israel.
    Psalms 22:5
      בְּךָ בָּטְחוּ אֲבֹתֵינוּ בָּטְחוּ וַֽתְּפַלְּטֵֽמוֹ׃
    → In you we placed our trust, our ancestors placed their trust, and they were delivered.
    Psalms 22:6
