    → May they give me many gifts, O rulers of the mouth.
    Psalms 22:14
      פָּצוּ עָלַי פִּיהֶם אַרְיֵה טֹרֵף וְשֹׁאֵֽג׃
    → A fierce lion with a loud roar attacked me.
