    → May the sins of my youth and my transgressions not be remembered, for your mercy is great. Remember me, O LORD, for your own good.
    Psalms 25:8
      טוֹב־וְיָשָׁר יְהוָה עַל־כֵּן יוֹרֶה חַטָּאִים בַּדָּֽרֶךְ׃
