    → For they have hidden their secrets from me; they have concealed them from my heart.
    Psalms 35:8
      תְּבוֹאֵהוּ שׁוֹאָה לֹֽא־יֵדָע וְרִשְׁתּוֹ אֲשֶׁר־טָמַן תִּלְכְּדוֹ בְּשׁוֹאָה יִפָּל־בָּֽהּ׃
    → It will be seen that he will not know, and those who are trapped in his schemes will fall into destruction.
    Psalms 35:9
      וְנַפְשִׁי תָּגִיל בַּיהוָה תָּשִׂישׂ בִּישׁוּעָתֽוֹ׃
    → And my soul will find comfort in Jehovah’s salvation.
    Psalms 35:10
