    → And may your path be one of truth and righteousness. May your ways be bright and shining, in your right hand.
    Psalms 45:6
      חִצֶּיךָ שְׁנוּנִים עַמִּים תַּחְתֶּיךָ יִפְּלוּ בְּלֵב אוֹיְבֵי הַמֶּֽלֶךְ׃
    → Your two nations will fall under your control; their hearts will be filled with hatred towards the king.
    Psalms 45:7
      כִּסְאֲךָ אֱלֹהִים עוֹלָם וָעֶד שֵׁבֶט מִישֹׁר שֵׁבֶט מַלְכוּתֶֽךָ׃
    → Your throne shall be a place where God reigns forever and ever. It will be the source of your kingdom.
    Psalms 45:8
