    → He will hear, and he will answer them. He will sit at the head of the throne, and there will be no one who can replace him. And they will not fear the Lord.
    Psalms 55:21
      שָׁלַח יָדָיו בִּשְׁלֹמָיו חִלֵּל בְּרִיתֽוֹ׃
    → He stretched out his hands in his hands, breaking his covenant.
    Psalms 55:22
