    → Just as milk and honey nourish the soul, so too will those who sing joyfully fill our hearts with happiness.
    Psalms 63:7
      אִם־זְכַרְתִּיךָ עַל־יְצוּעָי בְּאַשְׁמֻרוֹת אֶהְגֶּה־בָּֽךְ׃
    → If you remember my instructions, then you will be able to fulfill them.
    Psalms 63:8
      כִּֽי־הָיִיתָ עֶזְרָתָה לִּי וּבְצֵל כְּנָפֶיךָ אֲרַנֵּֽן׃
    → For you have been my help, and with the light of your wings, I can shine.
    Psalms 63:9
