    → And those who seek to do evil will be punished. Their souls will come to ruin in the depths of the earth.
    Psalms 63:11
      יַגִּירֻהוּ עַל־יְדֵי־חָרֶב מְנָת שֻׁעָלִים יִהְיֽוּ׃
    → It will be led away by the power of evil spirits.
    Psalms 63:12
      וְהַמֶּלֶךְ יִשְׂמַח בֵּאלֹהִים יִתְהַלֵּל כָּל־הַנִּשְׁבָּע בּוֹ כִּי יִסָּכֵר פִּי דֽוֹבְרֵי־שָֽׁקֶר׃
    → And the king will rejoice in God; all those who praise Him will sing praises to Him, because the lips of those who speak lies will be silenced.
  Psalms 63 [en]: 12 vv, 2s
