    → The evil one has taken me by force from my own people, from those who are righteous and holy.
    Psalms 71:5
      כִּֽי־אַתָּה תִקְוָתִי אֲדֹנָי יְהוִה מִבְטַחִי מִנְּעוּרָֽי׃
    → For you are my prayer, O LORD Jehovah, from my youth.
