    → Do not abandon me in my old age, just as you did with all my strength. Do not leave me behind.
    Psalms 71:10
      כִּֽי־אָמְרוּ אוֹיְבַי לִי וְשֹׁמְרֵי נַפְשִׁי נוֹעֲצוּ יַחְדָּֽו׃
    → For they said, “Oh my friends, I will protect my soul.” They advised me together.
