      לֵאמֹר אֱלֹהִים עֲזָבוֹ רִֽדְפוּ וְתִפְשׂוּהוּ כִּי־אֵין מַצִּֽיל׃
    → And they said, “God has abandoned him; they will pursue and capture him, for there is no one who can save him.”
    Psalms 71:12
      אֱלֹהִים אַל־תִּרְחַק מִמֶּנִּי אֱלֹהַי לְעֶזְרָתִי חֽוּשָׁה׃
    → God, do not distance yourself from me. O God, please be my helper.
    Psalms 71:13
      יֵבֹשׁוּ יִכְלוּ שֹׂטְנֵי נַפְשִׁי יַֽעֲטוּ חֶרְפָּה וּכְלִמָּה מְבַקְשֵׁי רָעָתִֽי׃
    → May they be punished; may the wicked of the soul suffer disgrace and shame. May all those who seek my harm be destroyed.
