      וְלֹא יִהְיוּ ׀ כַּאֲבוֹתָם דּוֹר סוֹרֵר וּמֹרֶה דּוֹר לֹא־הֵכִין לִבּוֹ וְלֹא־נֶאֶמְנָה אֶת־אֵל רוּחֽוֹ׃
    → And they shall not be like those who are cruel and harsh, who are not prepared to listen to others’ opinions. Nor shall they believe in the Lord of Spirits.
    Psalms 78:9
