    → And he commanded that the gates of heaven be opened.
    Psalms 78:24
      וַיַּמְטֵר עֲלֵיהֶם מָן לֶאֱכֹל וּדְגַן־שָׁמַיִם נָתַן לָֽמוֹ׃
    → And he provided them with food to eat. He also gave them fish from the heavens.
    Psalms 78:25
