    → And he lay down near his tent, around his dwelling place.
    Psalms 78:29
      וַיֹּאכְלוּ וַיִּשְׂבְּעוּ מְאֹד וְתַֽאֲוָתָם יָבִא לָהֶֽם׃
    → And they ate and rejoiced greatly; their joy came upon them.
    Psalms 78:30
