    → Why will the nations say, “These are our gods”? They should know that in our eyes, their bloodshed is an act of revenge for the blood of your servants.
    Psalms 79:11
      תָּבוֹא לְפָנֶיךָ אֶנְקַת אָסִיר כְּגֹדֶל זְרוֹעֲךָ הוֹתֵר בְּנֵי תְמוּתָֽה׃
    → I will come before you as a prisoner, like your most noble descendant from the line of Tamuah.
    Psalms 79:12
