    → And let them sit beside us, seven in number, at their feet. For they have suffered the same disgrace that you have suffered, O Lord.
    Psalms 79:13
      וַאֲנַחְנוּ עַמְּךָ ׀ וְצֹאן מַרְעִיתֶךָ נוֹדֶה לְּךָ לְעוֹלָם לְדֹר וָדֹר נְסַפֵּר תְּהִלָּתֶֽךָ׃
    → We will be your people, and our sheep from your flock will be dedicated to you forever. Your songs will be sung for all time.
  Psalms 79 [en]: 13 vv, 2s
    Psalms 80:1
      לַמְנַצֵּחַ אֶל־שֹׁשַׁנִּים עֵדוּת לְאָסָף מִזְמֽוֹר׃
