    → And the words of hatred made me angry, and they fought against me.
    Psalms 109:4
      תַּֽחַת־אַהֲבָתִי יִשְׂטְנוּנִי וַאֲנִי תְפִלָּֽה׃
    → Under my love, they will trample me, and I shall cry out in pain.
    Psalms 109:5
      וַיָּשִׂימוּ עָלַי רָעָה תַּחַת טוֹבָה וְשִׂנְאָה תַּחַת אַהֲבָתִֽי׃
    → They placed evil under good, and hatred under love.
    Psalms 109:6
