    → A wicked and evil man will stand on his right side.
    Psalms 109:7
      בְּהִשָּׁפְטוֹ יֵצֵא רָשָׁע וּתְפִלָּתוֹ תִּהְיֶה לַֽחֲטָאָֽה׃
    → In his judgment, the wicked will be punished, and their prayers will become a source of sin.
    Psalms 109:8
      יִֽהְיֽוּ־יָמָיו מְעַטִּים פְּקֻדָּתוֹ יִקַּח אַחֵֽר׃
    → His days will be few; his troubles will continue.
    Psalms 109:9
