    → It shall be after his brother’s death, in a different time. His name will be forgotten in that time.
    Psalms 109:14
      יִזָּכֵר ׀ עֲוֺן אֲבֹתָיו אֶל־יְהוָה וְחַטַּאת אִמּוֹ אַל־תִּמָּֽח׃
    → Let him remember the sins of his ancestors before Jehovah, and the sins of his mother, so that he may not be destroyed.
    Psalms 109:15
