    → Hod and Hador acted, and their righteousness will always stand.
    Psalms 111:4
      זֵכֶר עָשָׂה לְנִפְלְאֹתָיו חַנּוּן וְרַחוּם יְהוָֽה׃
    → He made for his people a place of refuge and mercy from the Lord.
    Psalms 111:5
      טֶרֶף נָתַן לִֽירֵאָיו יִזְכֹּר לְעוֹלָם בְּרִיתֽוֹ׃
    → Teref gave his followers a promise that they would remember his covenant forever.
    Psalms 111:6
      כֹּחַ מַעֲשָׂיו הִגִּיד לְעַמּוֹ לָתֵת לָהֶם נַחֲלַת גּוֹיִֽם׃
    → His actions told his people that they should give them a share of the land.
    Psalms 111:7
