    → His actions are true, and his judgments are just. All of his decrees are indeed righteous.
    Psalms 111:8
      סְמוּכִים לָעַד לְעוֹלָם עֲשׂוּיִם בֶּאֱמֶת וְיָשָֽׁר׃
    → They are truly eternal, made from genuine and pure materials.
    Psalms 111:9
      פְּדוּת ׀ שָׁלַח לְעַמּוֹ צִוָּֽה־לְעוֹלָם בְּרִיתוֹ קָדוֹשׁ וְנוֹרָא שְׁמֽוֹ׃
    → He sent forth a command to his people, a covenant that is holy and eternal.
    Psalms 111:10
      רֵאשִׁית חָכְמָה ׀ יִרְאַת יְהוָה שֵׂכֶל טוֹב לְכָל־עֹשֵׂיהֶם תְּהִלָּתוֹ עֹמֶדֶת לָעַֽד׃
    → The beginning of wisdom is the fear of Jehovah. Good intelligence is necessary for all their actions; its teachings will always remain true.
  Psalms 111 [en]: 10 vv, 1s
    Psalms 112:1
      הַלְלוּ יָהּ ׀ אַשְׁרֵי־אִישׁ יָרֵא אֶת־יְהוָה בְּמִצְוֺתָיו חָפֵץ מְאֹֽד׃
    → Hallelujah! Those who fear the LORD and obey His commandments, they truly desire to do so.
    Psalms 112:2
      גִּבּוֹר בָּאָרֶץ יִהְיֶה זַרְעוֹ דּוֹר יְשָׁרִים יְבֹרָֽךְ׃
    → A ruler who comes to this land will have a descendants who will live in righteousness and be blessed.
    Psalms 112:3
      הוֹן־וָעֹשֶׁר בְּבֵיתוֹ וְצִדְקָתוֹ עֹמֶדֶת לָעַֽד׃
    → He has many houses, and his righteousness stands forever.
    Psalms 112:4
      זָרַח בַּחֹשֶׁךְ אוֹר לַיְשָׁרִים חַנּוּן וְרַחוּם וְצַדִּֽיק׃
    → Light shone in the darkness for those who are righteous, kind, and compassionate.
    Psalms 112:5
      טֽוֹב־אִישׁ חוֹנֵן וּמַלְוֶה יְכַלְכֵּל דְּבָרָיו בְּמִשְׁפָּֽט׃
    → A good man is one who is wise and knows how to manage his affairs in a just manner.
    Psalms 112:6
      כִּֽי־לְעוֹלָם לֹא־יִמּוֹט לְזֵכֶר עוֹלָם יִהְיֶה צַדִּֽיק׃
    → For ever, it will never be forgotten; it will always remain a good memory.
    Psalms 112:7
      מִשְּׁמוּעָה רָעָה לֹא יִירָא נָכוֹן לִבּוֹ בָּטֻחַ בַּיהוָֽה׃
    → He who hears bad news will not be afraid; his heart will not tremble in fear.
    Psalms 112:8
      סָמוּךְ לִבּוֹ לֹא יִירָא עַד אֲשֶׁר־יִרְאֶה בְצָרָֽיו׃
