    → The tears of water fell from my eyes, because they did not keep your commandments.
    Psalms 119:137
      צַדִּיק אַתָּה יְהוָה וְיָשָׁר מִשְׁפָּטֶֽיךָ׃
    → You are righteous, O LORD, and your judgments are just.
