    → Let her be adorned with beauty, but only in a way that is righteous.
    Proverbs 16:32
      טוֹב אֶרֶךְ אַפַּיִם מִגִּבּוֹר וּמֹשֵׁל בְּרוּחוֹ מִלֹּכֵד עִֽיר׃
    → Good is long-lasting, even when it comes from a powerful and wise ruler. It remains beneficial even after the city has been destroyed.
