    → In the righteous, there is great honor and glory; but when the wicked rise up, people will seek them out.
    Proverbs 28:13
      מְכַסֶּה פְשָׁעָיו לֹא יַצְלִיחַ וּמוֹדֶה וְעֹזֵב יְרֻחָֽם׃
    → His sins will not be forgiven; he will be punished and abandoned.
    Proverbs 28:14
      אַשְׁרֵי אָדָם מְפַחֵד תָּמִיד וּמַקְשֶׁה לִבּוֹ יִפּוֹל בְּרָעָֽה׃
    → For those who are always afraid, and whose hearts are filled with sorrow, they will surely fall into evil.
    Proverbs 28:15
