    → A man of great wisdom will rule over Madon, and he will trust in Jehovah.
    Proverbs 28:26
      בּוֹטֵחַ בְּלִבּוֹ הוּא כְסִיל וְהוֹלֵךְ בְּחָכְמָה הוּא יִמָּלֵֽט׃
    → He who is stubborn in his heart is foolish; but he who acts with wisdom will succeed.
    Proverbs 28:27
