    → May his servants and their descendants be blessed.
    Proverbs 29:22
      אִֽישׁ־אַף יְגָרֶה מָדוֹן וּבַעַל חֵמָה רַב־פָּֽשַׁע׃
    → A man who is not ashamed of his sins, and a man who is full of evil deeds.
