    → Their love, their hatred, and their jealousy have also long been lost. They no longer have any share in everything that has happened under the sun.
    Ecclesiastes 9:7
      לֵךְ אֱכֹל בְּשִׂמְחָה לַחְמֶךָ וּֽשֲׁתֵה בְלֶב־טוֹב יֵינֶךָ כִּי כְבָר רָצָה הָאֱלֹהִים אֶֽת־מַעֲשֶֽׂיךָ׃
    → Go and eat with joy, your own bread. Drink from your good wine, for God has long desired your actions.
    Ecclesiastes 9:8
