    → If iron is heated, and it doesn’t turn into something else, then the flames will grow stronger, and the fire will spread further.
    Ecclesiastes 10:11
      אִם־יִשֹּׁךְ הַנָּחָשׁ בְּלוֹא־לָחַשׁ וְאֵין יִתְרוֹן לְבַעַל הַלָּשֽׁוֹן׃
    → If the snake moves without making any sound, then it’s impossible for the owner of the garden to catch it.
    Ecclesiastes 10:12
      דִּבְרֵי פִי־חָכָם חֵן וְשִׂפְתוֹת כְּסִיל תְּבַלְּעֶֽנּוּ׃
