    → The labor of the foolish will weary us, since they don’t know how to get to the city.
    Ecclesiastes 10:16
      אִֽי־לָךְ אֶרֶץ שֶׁמַּלְכֵּךְ נָעַר וְשָׂרַיִךְ בַּבֹּקֶר יֹאכֵֽלוּ׃
    → I will not go to a land where you ruled as a young man and maiden. In the morning, they will eat.
    Ecclesiastes 10:17
