    → In their weakness, the house will be destroyed; in their humility, the hands will be used to lift it up.
    Ecclesiastes 10:19
      לִשְׂחוֹק עֹשִׂים לֶחֶם וְיַיִן יְשַׂמַּח חַיִּים וְהַכֶּסֶף יַעֲנֶה אֶת־הַכֹּֽל׃
    → Let us bake bread and wine; let life rejoice, and money answer all things.
    Ecclesiastes 10:20
      גַּם בְּמַדָּֽעֲךָ מֶלֶךְ אַל־תְּקַלֵּל וּבְחַדְרֵי מִשְׁכָּבְךָ אַל־תְּקַלֵּל עָשִׁיר כִּי עוֹף הַשָּׁמַיִם יוֹלִיךְ אֶת־הַקּוֹל וּבַעַל כְּנָפַיִם יַגֵּיד דָּבָֽר׃
    → Also, in your knowledge, king, do not be cruel. In the chambers where you sleep, do not be cruel either. Do not be cruel to the rich, for the heavens will cover up their voices. And with wings, they will speak words.
