    Ecclesiastes 11:10
      וְהָסֵר כַּעַס מִלִּבֶּךָ וְהַעֲבֵר רָעָה מִבְּשָׂרֶךָ כִּֽי־הַיַּלְדוּת וְהַֽשַּׁחֲרוּת הָֽבֶל׃
    → And let anger leave your heart, and let you get rid of all the evil things that are in your words, just as in childhood and youth there was no darkness.
  Ecclesiastes 11 [en]: 10 vv, 2s
