    → On the day when the doors of the house were opened, and the people of the tribe stood up in fear. They removed their shields, for the darkness covered the streets.
    Ecclesiastes 12:4
      וְסֻגְּרוּ דְלָתַיִם בַּשּׁוּק בִּשְׁפַל קוֹל הַֽטַּחֲנָה וְיָקוּם לְקוֹל הַצִּפּוֹר וְיִשַּׁחוּ כָּל־בְּנוֹת הַשִּֽׁיר׃
    → And their doors were closed in the marketplace, amidst the sound of the hammering. Then, the sound of the trumpets would rise, and all the branches of the tree would be destroyed.
