    Song of Songs 1:2
      יִשָּׁקֵנִי מִנְּשִׁיקוֹת פִּיהוּ כִּֽי־טוֹבִים דֹּדֶיךָ מִיָּֽיִן׃
    → May they fill me with their sweet kisses, for they are truly good ones. From whom do you receive them?
