    → And you said, “Thus says the Lord Jehovah: I will take your wives and your daughters from the land of Canaan, from your father’s house. Your husbandmen and your flocks belong to me.”
    Ezekiel 16:4
      וּמוֹלְדוֹתַיִךְ בְּיוֹם הוּלֶּדֶת אֹתָךְ לֹֽא־כָרַּת שָׁרֵּךְ וּבְמַיִם לֹֽא־רֻחַצְתְּ לְמִשְׁעִי וְהָמְלֵחַ לֹא הֻמְלַחַתְּ וְהָחְתֵּל לֹא חֻתָּֽלְתְּ׃
    → And from your mother’s womb, on the day you were born, your hair was not combed, and in the water, you were not bathed for purification. Your body was not washed clean, and your nails were not cut.
    Ezekiel 16:5
