    → And I built for you a high place, and I made it a hill in every direction.
    Ezekiel 16:25
      אֶל־כָּל־רֹאשׁ דֶּרֶךְ בָּנִית רָֽמָתֵךְ וַתְּתַֽעֲבִי אֶת־יָפְיֵךְ וַתְּפַשְּׂקִי אֶת־רַגְלַיִךְ לְכָל־עוֹבֵר וַתַּרְבִּי אֶת־תַּזְנוּתָֽיִךְ׃
    → To every head that walks along your path, I will destroy your beauty. I will break your feet for every passerby. I will also destroy your lips.
