    → They sanctified the sacrifices. They gathered together the elders, all the inhabitants of the earth. They went to the house of Jehovah, your God, and they cried out to Jehovah.
    Joel 1:15
      אֲהָהּ לַיּוֹם כִּי קָרוֹב יוֹם יְהוָה וּכְשֹׁד מִשַׁדַּי יָבֽוֹא׃
    → Ah, that day will come soon, when the Day of the LORD approaches. And when the destroyer comes from heaven…
    Joel 1:16
