    → They were trampled under their feet; their bodies were destroyed. They were destroyed by the flames, because the pride of those who were proud caused this.
    Joel 1:18
      מַה־נֶּאֶנְחָה בְהֵמָה נָבֹכוּ עֶדְרֵי בָקָר כִּי אֵין מִרְעֶה לָהֶם גַּם־עֶדְרֵי הַצֹּאן נֶאְשָֽׁמוּ׃
    → What a laugh it is when those animals are trapped in the fields, as there’s no way for them to get out. Even the sheep have been trapped too.
