    → Holy God, I call out to You! For fire has consumed all the trees in the forest, and all the branches of the trees have been burned up.
    Joel 1:20
      גַּם־בַּהֲמוֹת שָׂדֶה תַּעֲרוֹג אֵלֶיךָ כִּי יָֽבְשׁוּ אֲפִיקֵי מָיִם וְאֵשׁ אָכְלָה נְאוֹת הַמִּדְבָּֽר׃
    → Even in the fields, there will be destruction for you, because the waters will be dried up, and fire will consume the crops.
