    → If you do not listen, and if you do not take my words seriously, then I say, “Lord, your army!” I have sent the curse upon you. I will also destroy your blessings. And I will also destroy her blessings, because you do not take my words seriously.
    Malachi 2:3
      הִנְנִי גֹעֵר לָכֶם אֶת־הַזֶּרַע וְזֵרִיתִי פֶרֶשׁ עַל־פְּנֵיכֶם פֶּרֶשׁ חַגֵּיכֶם וְנָשָׂא אֶתְכֶם אֵלָֽיו׃
    → I am angry with you for this seed. I have scattered it before your faces, as a symbol of your festivals. I will take you there.
    Malachi 2:4
