    → And I have come to you for judgment. I was witness to those who rushed into the courts and went to the tribunals, and they lied and committed fraud. They were worthless people who did not fear me at all. The Lord, the Almighty, said: “They do not fear me at all.”
    Malachi 3:6
      כִּי אֲנִי יְהוָה לֹא שָׁנִיתִי וְאַתֶּם בְּנֵֽי־יַעֲקֹב לֹא כְלִיתֶֽם׃
    → For I, the LORD, have not changed my mind. And you, children of Jacob, are not worthless.
    Malachi 3:7
