    → Bring all these offerings into the house of the LORD. May they be used as food in my house and in my storehouse. Then the LORD, the God of hosts, said, “If I do not open the doors of heaven for you, then I will pour out blessings upon you without limit.”
    Malachi 3:11
      וְגָעַרְתִּי לָכֶם בָּֽאֹכֵל וְלֹֽא־יַשְׁחִת לָכֶם אֶת־פְּרִי הָאֲדָמָה וְלֹא־תְשַׁכֵּל לָכֶם הַגֶּפֶן בַּשָּׂדֶה אָמַר יְהוָה צְבָאֽוֹת׃
